OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly
OL,6,Fcloudy evening and night with a few
OL,7,Flight showers across Lothian and
OL,8,FBorders. Dry with clear periods across
OL,9,FDumfries and Galloway along with a few
OL,10,Ffog patches.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FRemaining rather cloudy with a
OL,13,Ffew light showers across Lothian and
OL,14,FBorders. Dry by day in the southwest
OL,15,Fwith a little brightness possible,
OL,16,Fcloudier in the evening with some
OL,17,Fshowers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
