OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith a few light showers on Saturday
OL,7,Fand early Sunday. Otherwise becoming
OL,8,Fdry and partly cloudy with overnight
OL,9,Ffrost and fog.
